{"id":"0df0123405bbc66d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-substitution-composition.md","title":"df-substitution-composition","display":"df-substitution-composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"label":"56-df-substitution-composition","aliases":["56-df-substitution-composition"],"display":"df-substitution-composition","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-substitution-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-substitution-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-composition"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-substitution-composition\"><code>df-substitution-composition</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li>后缀应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\">\\(t\\sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\circ\\tau\\coloneqq\\{(x,(x\\sigma)\\tau)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\circ\\tau\\coloneqq\\{(x,(x\\sigma)\\tau)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\\coloneqq\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}\\coloneqq\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\circ\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),\\qquad\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(t(\\sigma\\circ\\tau)=(t\\sigma)\\tau\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\circ\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V),\\qquad\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(t(\\sigma\\circ\\tau)=(t\\sigma)\\tau\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里保留后缀组合：σ∘τ 表示先 σ 后 τ，方向与通常的前缀函数复合相反。输出图每个变量恰有一个 T 中的像；项级等式由结构归纳得到。原书通常直接把后缀组合写成 στ。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1.3，印刷第32页，OCR页块53。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-substitution-composition","text":"`df-substitution-composition`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"tar