substitution]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-substitution-composition]]。"},{"id":"38760d0fb2c20b34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta=(\\delta_0,\\ldots,\\delta_{n-1})\\in S^n$。带标签步骤见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]；后缀组合及恒等替换 $\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。"},{"id":"6ab7b6083e677200","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot,T,S,\\bot$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]；$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]；$\\iota=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal V}$ 见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]，$[x:=t]$ 与目标替换见 [[56-df-single-variable-substitution]]。$E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot$，$\\delta\\in S$；$G\\in\\mathcal G$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$f,g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)$，$m=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，各 $s_i,t_i,t\\in T$。以下六族中的方程 $e\\in T^2$ 由该族给出的等式确定，且要求 $e\\notin G$。"},{"id":"e7881759a56db8a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in S$；后缀组合及恒等替换见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。"},{"id":"9e293cb25f60ed71","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 及 $S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-substitution-application]]；后缀组合见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]。$s,t\\in T$。"},{"id":"12f957d86ed7612e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition.md]]"},{"id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c6237425d7c09fc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\